      "id": "claim_3c8a40cdc7e4424c80df8affb425bb05",
      "statement": "Brokers configure JAAS via the KafkaServer section (optionally listener-prefixed) or listener.name.{listenerName}.{saslMechanism}.sasl.jaas.config, which takes precedence; clients use sasl.jaas.config, which overrides java.security.auth.login.config.",
