      "statement": "The default OAUTHBEARER implementation uses unsecured JWTs for non-production only; production brokers use OAuthBearerValidatorCallbackHandler with a JWKS endpoint and clients use DefaultJwtRetriever delegating to ClientCredentialsJwtRetriever or FileJwtRetriever.",
